Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-23-2001||02:58 AM||||I'm thumbing through Gary Witzenburg's "Fiero" book (New Edition). On page 70 it says that the production Indy came with stock black plastic lug covers with red round stickers on the end. (aka red lug covers) Were any sold from the dealer with them? Anyone know for sure? Theres a  color pic of a wheel in the book with them.<P><BR>TFTI <sub>(<B>T</B>hanks <B>F</B>or <B>T</B>he <B>I</B>nfo)</sub>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><I>Haze</I>  <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">  <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
