Z||000002||LZeitgeist||07-23-2001||08:47 AM||||That's the first I'd heard about that...<P>Are you sure he wasn't talking about the 'red round decals' around the edge of the rims, and that you may have misread how he phrased it...?<P>:::scratching head at that one:::||||reg||1
